# Plant-proprietary controlled-diff fixtures (see
# docs/protocols/2026-05-13-controlled-pid-diff-collection.md).
# Only the .gitkeep / README.md tracking the directory layout
# may enter git; .pid files MUST NOT.
test-file/controlled-diff/before/*.pid
test-file/controlled-diff/after/*.pid

# Full SmartPlant symbol library unpacked from the RefData backup zips
